  unitName: Eclipse Sibyl Madia
  unitId: 60245
  unitNumber: 873
  description: The second youngest of the Six Sibyl Sisters. The darkness that consumed
    the human race came pouring into innocent Madia, growing to an uncontrollable
    level, and forcing her to attack her beloved elder sister, Sola. Madia was aware
    that Sola was attempting to help her, but her thoughts ended up contradicting
    those of her elder sister. She came to believe that by exterminating all humans,
    the cause of all this calamity, she would be able to recover the relationship
    she had once shared with her sisters. And thus, with Sola as the main obstacle
    keeping her from achieving her goal, she surrendered herself to the darkness
    once more in order to eliminate her.
  summonDesc: "My sister keeps intruding...<br>So I can't be with her anymore...<br>If
    she would just go away\u2026"
  fusionDesc: "More power is entering my body...<br>But...I don't want any more\u2026"
  evoDesc: "I no longer have control<br>over my own self.<br>It's like...I'm somebody
    different\u2026"
  element: 6
  rarity: 5
